                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "c6865e78-9cf1-3f2b-80b1-4444f8a51ecd",
                        "entry_id": "eb3efa82-a97d-3032-a243-9c97406bf8f5",
                        "glosses": [
                            "цветник, сделанный в виде какой-либо геометрической фигуры"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "46f823eb-5550-423f-a333-2925c3e85909",
                                "sense_id": "c6865e78-9cf1-3f2b-80b1-4444f8a51ecd",
                                "text": "На клумбе возле дома сидел петух. Увидел он девочку и закричал: — Ку-ка-ре-ку! Смотри, народ! Наша девочка вся в золоте идёт!."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "3d1cfa0d-f7b3-4e90-a002-ceeaf94018fa",
                        "source_entry_id": "eb3efa82-a97d-3032-a243-9c97406bf8f5",
                        "source_sense_id": "c6865e78-9cf1-3f2b-80b1-4444f8a51ecd",
                        "target_lang_word": "flower bed",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "flower bed",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "46252622-e190-39fb-96ee-9c6d24d626f0",
                                        "entry_id": "38972e58-7d96-3f44-9cc1-f2aa3953ac50",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Alternative form of flowerbed."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "alt-of",
                                            "alternative"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f8a476cc-ddb2-40c7-bb15-d88eb7e28498",
                                                "sense_id": "46252622-e190-39fb-96ee-9c6d24d626f0",
                                                "text": "And strange, too, it is to stand on Primrose Hill, as I did but a day before writing this last chapter, to see the great province of houses, dim and blue through the haze of the smoke and mist, vanishing at last into the vague lower sky, to see the people walking to and fro among the flower beds on the hill, to see the sightseers about the Martian machine that stands there still, to hear the tumult of playing children, and to recall the time when I saw it all bright and clear cut, hard and silent, under the dawn of that last great day. . ."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "112709d0-084e-4c19-9e6b-3c136c697fce",
                        "source_entry_id": "eb3efa82-a97d-3032-a243-9c97406bf8f5",
                        "source_sense_id": "c6865e78-9cf1-3f2b-80b1-4444f8a51ecd",
                        "target_lang_word": "Beet",
                        "target_lang_code": "de",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "Beet",
                                "target_lang_code": "de",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "0e2d36b4-36ab-3b92-a692-6c18e7923506",
                                        "entry_id": "48eaca1a-444c-36a2-aacf-3431d19a6f2c",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "abgegrenztes Stück Boden, das zur Zucht von Zier- und Nutzpflanzen genutzt wird"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d0cd0339-8061-4912-a796-64e275c05338",
                                                "sense_id": "0e2d36b4-36ab-3b92-a692-6c18e7923506",
                                                "text": "Der Gärtner pflanzte auf seinem Beet stets nur Karotten."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f8825792-adac-4d65-b729-5dfda6790d85",
                                                "sense_id": "0e2d36b4-36ab-3b92-a692-6c18e7923506",
                                                "text": "„Vor den Häusern reihten sich gut gepflegte Beete mit Tomaten, Paprika, Gurken und Salat.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7a35159e-93dc-444d-89cd-5b32dc4e8145",
                                                "sense_id": "0e2d36b4-36ab-3b92-a692-6c18e7923506",
                                                "text": "„Eine kleine Ziegelmauer rahmt ein ordentliches Beet mit duftendem Lavendel ein.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2cc7d1f3-f354-4cc5-a002-3cbce6df4592",
                                                "sense_id": "0e2d36b4-36ab-3b92-a692-6c18e7923506",
                                                "text": "„Ein paar Beete mit Narzissen, Veilchen und Tulpen blühten.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5d58b1e8-f9e5-4866-89c9-f957660f025b",
                                                "sense_id": "0e2d36b4-36ab-3b92-a692-6c18e7923506",
                                                "text": "„Schon sahen sie sich in Hemdsärmeln am Rande eines Beetes beim Rosen-Okulieren, Umgraben, Hacken, Prüfen der Gartenerde und Austopfen von Tulpen.“"
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "word_linkages": []
            }
        ],
